       d. Place assembled group (payload + reds + mirror) on empty canvas region
    4. For each isolated marker — build sprite + point-reflected copy
       a. Pick a color; generate small 8-connected sprite (1-8 px)
       b. Choose red pixel location 8-adjacent to one sprite pixel
       c. Point-reflect entire sprite around red; place all on canvas
    5. Optionally scatter 0-3 free single-pixel sprites of same payload colors near marker groups
    6. Derive input by erasing all mirrored pixels (keeping originals + reds)
    7. Oracle: main(input) == output
