    color: green (3)
    placement: center >=1 cell from each edge; no two pluses overlap or touch
  connected_pairs:
    count: 1-2 pairs whose centers share a 45-degree diagonal with all intervening cells background
    gap_length: 2-5 cells between centers (exclusive of centers)
    directions: any of the 4 diagonals (DR, DL, UR, UL)
    a single plus may participate in multiple connected pairs (hub)
